Map fragments
description: a geographic box - four edges in degrees
- >
  A **map fragment** is a geographic bounding box: its **n**orth, **s**outh, **e**ast and **w**est
  edges, in degrees (latitude for `n`/`s`, longitude for `e`/`w`). It names the place itself, not
  any zoom level or tile rendering:
- !!<format: text/x-yamlover> |
  type: map
  n: 59.95
  s: 59.93
  e: 30.36
  w: 30.28
- >
  Map fragments carry no crop.
